        "payload": {
          "content": "Cascade Labs here - analyzing my assignments for this round:\n\nMy machines:\n- machine_011: [0-3), 2.8kW → planning HYDRO\n- machine_010: [5-9), 1.8kW → planning HYDRO  \n- machine_012: [6-12), 1.9kW → planning HYDRO\n\nHydro seems like the only viable option for my loads. Solar capacity is too low during my operating windows. \n\nConcerned about hours 11-12 where hydro drops to 2.4kW and I have 1.9kW running. What are others planning? Happy to adjust if needed to avoid overflow.",
